OL,7,     Fgroup run by his father-in-law is
OL,8,     Fboth a bad husband and a gambler
OL,9,     Fdeeply in debt. Facing divorce and
OL,10,     Fostracism, he devises a cunning
OL,11,     Fplan involving murder. (1990)
